Short:    math fpu library
Uploader: cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Author:   cordierfr@wanadoo.fr (Frédéric Cordier)
Type:     sys/libs

It's a short library that can use 68881,68882,68040
and 68060 FPU mathematical instructions set.
You need one of these (co-)processors to use that
library.
